// Animal Crossing: New Horizons 3.0.0, 120 FPS + SpeedFix (main module: 120 FPS enabler and game speed corrections)
// 120 FPS: every frame is presented on its own refresh of a 120 Hz screen (Ryujinx: VSync Custom 120;
// Citron / Eden: speed limit 200 %); the NES / SNES furniture games keep the console's 60 per second
// Rules: speeds per update x1/4, accelerations x1/16, update counts x4, per-update rate r -> 1 - (1 - r)^(1/4)
// Use together with the parameter pack
@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

